Inspect agent extension configuration.

Use 'azd config' to change azd user configuration.

Usage
  azd ai agent config [command]

Available Commands
  list-alpha : Display the list of agent features in alpha stage.

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for config
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
  Display the agent features in alpha stage
    azd ai agent config list-alpha

Use azd ai agent config [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
